			"notes": "- The map zooms out as far as it takes to see the whole world, however far it has been explored, and a new button shows all of it at once.\n- Labels that would overlap gather into one readable list, the others keeping their dots; clicking the list zooms in until they spread apart.\n- Clicking a portal jumps to its other end, switching to the Nether or the End if that is where it leads.\n- A player who turned off Pandorical's Show me on maps is left off the players and homes layers.\n- A damaged chunk in the saved world is skipped instead of stopping the rest of its region from being drawn.\n- An older Pandorical no longer stops the server from starting; the map runs with a warning instead."
		},
